  Python interpreter          Managed (.hc/venv)                Empty keeps hc's managed .hc/venv. A command or path selects an external Python and bypasses management. Editing ne…
  Coding agent                claude                            Preset for the next generation or repair. A nonempty agent.command overrides this preset.
  Custom agent command        []                                An argv array, not a shell command. Edit hc.yaml for custom arguments; reset to [] to use the preset.
  LeetCode site               com                               Default for fetch and login. Online submissions use the currently signed-in account.






















